sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as External Client
    participant SVC as Kubernetes Service<br/>ClusterIP 8443/TCP
    participant TLS as kube-rbac-proxy<br/>TLS Termination<br/>8443/TCP HTTPS
    participant AuthN as Authentication<br/>Handler
    participant AuthZ as Authorization<br/>Union Chain
    participant Proxy as ReverseProxy
    participant Upstream as Upstream Service<br/>localhost:8080 HTTP
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS

    Note over Client,K8sAPI: Standard Authenticated Request Flow

    Client->>SVC: HTTPS/8443<br/>Authorization: Bearer <token>
    SVC->>TLS: Forward to pod<br/>port 8443

    alt Path matches ignore-paths
        TLS->>Proxy: Bypass auth chain
        Proxy->>Upstream: Forward request<br/>HTTP localhost
        Upstream-->>Proxy: Response
        Proxy-->>TLS: Response
        TLS-->>SVC: HTTPS Response
        SVC-->>Client: Response
    else Normal authenticated path
        TLS->>AuthN: Decrypted request<br/>+ Bearer token

        alt OIDC Mode
            AuthN->>AuthN: Validate OIDC token<br/>locally
        else Delegating Auth Mode
            AuthN->>K8sAPI: TokenReview<br/>validate bearer token
            K8sAPI-->>AuthN: TokenReview response<br/>(authenticated=true/false)
        end

        AuthN->>AuthZ: Authenticated request<br/>+ user info

        Note over AuthZ: Union authorizer evaluates in order

        AuthZ->>AuthZ: 1. Hardcoded metrics authorizer<br/>(OpenShift monitoring)
        AuthZ->>AuthZ: 2. Static file-based rules
        AuthZ->>K8sAPI: 3. SubjectAccessReview<br/>check RBAC permissions
        K8sAPI-->>AuthZ: SAR response<br/>(allowed=true/false)

        AuthZ->>Proxy: Authorized request<br/>+ auth headers injected

        Proxy->>Upstream: HTTP request<br/>localhost with identity headers
        Upstream-->>Proxy: HTTP response
        Proxy-->>TLS: Response
        TLS-->>SVC: HTTPS Response
        SVC-->>Client: HTTPS Response
    end

    Note over Client,K8sAPI: Health Check Flow

    Client->>TLS: GET /healthz<br/>(dedicated port)
    TLS-->>Client: 200 OK
